# components.dat, the components of the LPT final integrand, their templates and linear kinds (read by lpt_tables.py).
# Generated by tools/pt_autogen (python -m pt_autogen regenerate), pt_autogen 1.2 (2026-10-17): + the derived LPT chain.
# Identity: the integrand of the final integral is sum over the components c of W_c sum_j c_j^c(q) M_j
#   (component_entries.dat), with the component weights W = (template weights) @ T and T[t, c] = 1 when the
#   template t is listed on the line of c.  A cumulant component is the set of terms of the cumulant expansion whose
#   cumulants have the families listed (origin, '*'-joined), the constant 1 joining the family A.  An EFT component
#   copies the entries of its origin.  A linear kind collects the terms first order in one of its tree rows, which
#   the final integral replaces by linear theory (lpt.LPT._linear_rows).
# Records:
#   template   name b1 b2 bG2 bGamma3      the exponents of a bias monomial ('eft' for an EFT template)
#   linear     name row [row]              a linear kind and its tree rows
#   component  name kind templates linear origin
#              (kind 'cumulant' or 'eft', the templates ','-joined, linear '-' when the component has no linear part)
# Order: the templates in the order of the template weights, the linear kinds in column order, the components in
#   the column order of T.
# Counts: 13 templates (1 EFT), 3 linear kinds, 23 components (1 EFT).
# columns: record name ...
template   ONE          0 0 0 0
template   B1           1 0 0 0
template   B1_B1        2 0 0 0
template   B2           0 1 0 0
template   B1_B2        1 1 0 0
template   B2_B2        0 2 0 0
template   BG2          0 0 1 0
template   B1_BG2       1 0 1 0
template   B2_BG2       0 1 1 0
template   BG2_BG2      0 0 2 0
template   BGAMMA3      0 0 0 1
template   B1_BGAMMA3   1 0 0 1
template   CTR          eft
linear     ZA           X_LIN_GT Y_LIN_GT
linear     B1           U_LIN
linear     XI           XI_LIN
component  ZA     cumulant ONE         ZA  A
component  AA     cumulant ONE         -   A*A
component  A22    cumulant ONE         -   A22
component  A13    cumulant ONE         -   A13
component  W112   cumulant ONE         -   W112
component  U10    cumulant B1          B1  U
component  A_U    cumulant B1          -   A*U
component  A10    cumulant B1          -   A10
component  XI     cumulant B1_B1       XI  xi
component  A_XI   cumulant B1_B1       -   A*xi
component  U_U    cumulant B1_B1,B2    -   U*U
component  U11    cumulant B1_B1       -   U11
component  U20    cumulant B2          -   U20
component  XI_U   cumulant B1_B2       -   U*xi
component  XI_XI  cumulant B2_B2       -   xi*xi
component  UPS    cumulant BG2         -   Upsilon
component  V10    cumulant BG2         -   V10
component  V12    cumulant B1_BG2      -   V12
component  CHI    cumulant B2_BG2      -   chi
component  ZETA   cumulant BG2_BG2     -   zeta
component  UB3    cumulant BGAMMA3     -   U_Gamma3
component  THETA  cumulant B1_BGAMMA3  -   theta
component  CTR    eft      CTR         ZA  ZA
